    stem: "Enterprise/Managing. Read the information supplied and answer the questions which follow. M6 Motors: Alan Naughton is an entrepreneur who set up M6 Motors in 2011. The business is now one of the leading car sourcing companies in Ireland. As the business grew Alan expanded his workforce. The company specialises in high specification cars at competitive prices.",
