    section: "3", questionRef: "2019 HL Section 3 Q4(a)",
    questionText: "A Chief Financial Officer (CFO) in a business needs exceptional communication skills and needs to adapt his/her communication style and message to different stakeholders. (a)(i) Discuss the importance for a business of effective communication. (a)(ii) Illustrate two barriers that a manager has to overcome to communicate effectively with staff, providing a different example in each case. (20)",
