    questionText: "Read the information supplied and answer the question which follows. Hexagon Solutions is a global software design company operating in Dublin. It offers competitive salaries and long‐term contracts of employment to all employees. A team structure exists in the business where employees from all over the world work together on innovative projects. Staff ideas are accepted, and innovation is rewarded. Hexagon supports employees who take on further studies. Outline the different stages in Maslow’s hierarchy of needs theory and illustrate how Hexagon Solutions applies this theory to motivate its employees. (20)",
